    "created_at": "2016-05-03T02:14:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-03T02:14:34Z",
    "body": "I don't have one offhand.  XHR uses \"fully active\", not \"active\", in the places where it checks this stuff.  The visibility API has conditions other than activity.  Promise behavior in non-active situations is not really defined by any specs and probably not interoperable...  We would have to look at occurrences of \"active\" in various specs to try to find one that uses this in a simple way.  :(\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
