    "created_at": "2017-09-08T05:25:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-08T05:25:15Z",
    "body": "That's the theory, in specs, but it may not match the practice in UAs.\r\n\r\nThat is, a UA could easily have \"active\" testing true, but \"fully active\" testing false, in the removed iframe case.  And in particular, just because we determine that some APIs that tests \"fully active\" got false doesn't tell us much about APIs that should test \"active\".",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
