    "created_at": "2017-09-08T23:54:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-08T23:54:25Z",
    "body": "OK... but I think it should be OK to assume the spec is correct, at least for the purposes of solving this bug and writing some tests. I don't think we should block on possible implementations where you can be fully active but not active.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
