    "created_at": "2017-09-09T01:49:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-09T01:49:35Z",
    "body": "I think the problem is that we don't have good evidence that the spec matches reality, or would if it were implemented in web browsers.  So I'm worried about us ending up accidentally specifying something that's not actually web-compatible.  :(",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
